WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Most people start trading for freedom…
but eventually become dependent on screens.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Traditional trading demands constant attention,
emotional energy and time —

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The more time you spend on screens,
the less freedom you have.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I'm Ernestas. I've been in the Forex market for over 6 years —
trading, educating people and building communities.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
But gradually I started looking for smarter ways to trade.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
How to automate processes.
How to eliminate emotions.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
And how to build a system that works consistently
without constant involvement.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
That's exactly what this page is about.
Here I share automation solutions, a copy trading model

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and a mindset that helps transition from chaotic trading
to a more sustainable, structured path.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
If what matters to you is not just results, but also freedom —
you are in the right place.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
All the information is provided below.
